---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#fff'
    primaryTextColor: '#000'
    primaryBorderColor: '#000'
    lineColor: '#000'
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant CaptureModule
    participant ParserModule
    participant ReasoningModule
    participant VulnAnalysisModule
    participant ExploitationModule
    participant ReportingModule
    participant DataStore

    %% ---------- Inisialisasi ----------
    User->>CaptureModule: Start capture
    CaptureModule-->>DataStore: Save HAR file
    CaptureModule-->>ParserModule: HAR file

    %% ---------- Enumerasi awal ----------
    ParserModule-->>ReasoningModule: Endpoint list
    ReasoningModule-->>VulnAnalysisModule: Initial test cases
    VulnAnalysisModule->>DataStore: Save baseline per-endpoint

    %% ---------- Loop fuzz / eksplorasi ----------
    loop for each test case in queue
        VulnAnalysisModule->>ExploitationModule: Light PoC validation
        ExploitationModule-->>VulnAnalysisModule: Result (High / Ambiguous / Low)

        alt High-confidence finding
            VulnAnalysisModule->>ReportingModule: Confirmed vuln + evidence
        else Ambiguous AND depth < 3
            VulnAnalysisModule->>ReasoningModule: Context (req/resp, depth)
            ReasoningModule-->>VulnAnalysisModule: New test cases (depth + 1)
            %% note over VulnAnalysisModule: Enqueue only unseen endpoints/payloads
        else Low-confidence OR depth ≥ 3
            VulnAnalysisModule->>ReportingModule: FP / ignored
        end
    end

    %% ---------- Pelaporan ----------
    ReportingModule-->>DataStore: Save report
    ReportingModule-->>User: Final report